/* Replay — the base catalogue.
 *
 * Deliberately almost empty, and that is not an oversight. The English text is the key
 * (see `Loc`), so an English build needs no entries at all: every lookup falls through to
 * the key, which is the sentence. Entries appear here only where English itself needs a
 * value the key cannot carry — and a translation lives in its own `<code>.lproj` beside
 * this one, never in here.
 *
 * `tools/strings-audit.mjs` reports what a translator would have to cover. Do not hand-write
 * that inventory into this file: it would be a second list to keep in step with the source,
 * which is the thing the key-is-the-English choice exists to avoid.
 */

/* The app's own name is not translated, in any language. */
"Replay" = "Replay";
